# 2024年考研英语真题解析
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语
# 来源: 张剑黄皮书
# 描述: 2024年考研英语一真题核心知识点（2025版黄皮书）

{{阅读理解-Text1}}{{2024年Text1讨论"数字人民币对传统金融体系的影响"。央行数字货币推广改变支付生态和货币政策传导机制。高频词汇：central bank digital currency（央行数字货币）、monetary policy（货币政策）、payment system（支付系统）、financial inclusion（普惠金融）、digital wallet（数字钱包）。长难句：The rollout of central bank digital currencies, which promises to enhance financial inclusion and reduce transaction costs, also poses significant challenges to the traditional banking model and the existing monetary policy transmission mechanism.（which引导非限制性定语从句，poses和promises并列谓语）}}

{{阅读理解-Text2}}{{Text2分析"人工智能在医疗影像诊断中的应用"。AI辅助诊断准确率超过人类放射科医生。高频词汇：medical imaging（医疗影像）、diagnosis（诊断）、deep learning（深度学习）、radiologist（放射科医生）、accuracy（准确率）。解题技巧：举例说明处常设考点，注意例子支撑的论点。}}

{{阅读理解-Text3}}{{Text3聚焦"全球变暖与海平面上升"。冰川融化导致海平面上升威胁沿海城市。高频词汇：global warming（全球变暖）、sea level rise（海平面上升）、glacier（冰川）、coastal city（沿海城市）、climate adaptation（气候适应）。长难句：The accelerating rate of sea level rise, driven by the melting of polar ice caps and thermal expansion of seawater, poses an existential threat to coastal cities that are home to hundreds of millions of people worldwide.（driven by过去分词短语作原因状语，that引导定语从句）}}

{{阅读理解-Text4}}{{Text4探讨"基因编辑技术的伦理边界"。CRISPR技术使基因编辑更加精确但引发伦理争议。高频词汇：gene editing（基因编辑）、CRISPR（CRISPR技术）、bioethics（生物伦理）、genetic modification（基因改造）、informed consent（知情同意）。解题技巧：作者态度题需关注should, must等情态动词。}}

{{完形填空}}{{2024年完形填空主题为"科学精神与创新思维"。考查重点：1)动词辨析：pioneer/initiate/launch/inaugurate；2)名词搭配：scientific inquiry, innovative thinking, intellectual curiosity；3)介词短语：in pursuit of, in defiance of, in accordance with；4)连词逻辑：nevertheless表转折，consequently表因果。核心技巧：利用科学类文章的逻辑结构。}}

{{翻译}}{{翻译主题涉及"全球治理与可持续发展"。重点句型：1)同位语从句that的翻译；2)让步状语从句although/though的处理；3)目的状语in order to的翻译。翻译技巧：国际关系类术语需规范准确。高频词汇：sustainable development（可持续发展）、climate governance（气候治理）、carbon neutrality（碳中和）、green economy（绿色经济）、multilateral cooperation（多边合作）。}}

{{写作-小作文}}{{小作文为通知。格式要点：1)标题NOTICE居中；2)说明活动详情；3)注明联系方式和落款。高分句型：We are pleased to announce that...；All students are invited to...；For further details, please contact... 注意格式规范和信息完整。}}

{{写作-大作文}}{{大作文为图画作文，主题"传统文化的现代传承"。论述要点：1)描述图画揭示传统文化传承的寓意；2)分析传统文化面临的挑战；3)提出传承传统文化的建议。高分词汇：cultural heritage（文化遗产）、intangible heritage（非物质文化遗产）、revitalize（复兴）、authenticity（真实性）、innovation（创新）。闪光句型：The preservation of cultural heritage is not about freezing the past but about bringing it to life in the present.；Only by adapting to the times can tradition remain relevant.}}

{{高频词汇-2025版黄皮书-2024}}{{unprecedented（前所未有的）、unparalleled（无与伦比的）、unrivaled（无与伦比的）、incomparable（无与伦比的）、formidable（令人敬畏的）、insurmountable（不可逾越的）、daunting（令人生畏的）、challenging（有挑战性的）、arduous（艰巨的）、laborious（费力的）、intricate（复杂的）、elaborate（精心制作的）、complicated（复杂的）、sophisticated（精密的）、subtle（微妙的）、nuanced（有细微差别的）、ambiguous（模糊的）、equivocal（模棱两可的）、explicit（明确的）、unequivocal（明确的）}}

{{长难句分析-2025版黄皮书-2024}}{{1) The deployment of AI in medical imaging, which has shown remarkable accuracy in detecting certain types of cancer, raises important questions about the role of human judgment in clinical decision-making.（which引导非限制性定语从句，about介词短语作questions的定语）
2) What is particularly alarming about the current rate of sea level rise is that it is accelerating, meaning that the consequences for coastal communities will be far more severe than previously projected.（What引导主语从句，that引导表语从句，meaning that引导结果状语从句）
3) It is the potential of gene-editing technology to eliminate hereditary diseases that makes it so promising, yet it is the same potential that makes it so controversial.（两个It is...that...强调句型形成对比，yet连接转折）
4) Unless global cooperation on climate change is significantly strengthened, the targets set by the Paris Agreement—limiting global warming to 1.5 degrees Celsius—will remain out of reach.（Unless引导条件状语从句，破折号之间为插入语解释targets）}}

{{解题技巧-阅读-2025版黄皮书-2024}}{{1)注意文章中的"信号词"，标示逻辑关系和文章脉络；2)例证题的答案是例子所支撑的论点；3)观点对比题要区分不同立场；4)排除法：绝对化、偷换概念、无中生有的选项排除；5)时间管理：每篇阅读15-18分钟。}}

{{解题技巧-完形-2025版黄皮书-2024}}{{1)完形填空的"瞻前顾后"策略；2)利用"词汇复现"线索；3)动词题注意语义和搭配；4)连词题准确判断逻辑关系；5)做完后通读检查。}}

{{解题技巧-翻译-2025版黄皮书-2024}}{{1)翻译前先通读整个段落把握大意；2)长句翻译分步骤处理；3)专业术语翻译要准确；4)被动语态灵活处理；5)检查译文是否通顺。}}

{{核心语法-强调句}}{{强调句型It is/was+被强调部分+that/who+其余部分。考研高频考点：1)强调主语：It is the government that should take responsibility.；2)强调状语：It was in 2023 that the policy was implemented.；3)强调句与定语从句的区分：去掉It is/was和that/who后句子是否完整，完整则是强调句；4)not...until...的强调句型：It was not until...that...；5)特殊疑问句的强调：When was it that...?/Where was it that...?}}

{{核心语法-虚拟语气}}{{虚拟语气是考研英语高频考点。主要类型：1)与现在事实相反：If+主语+did/were, 主语+would/could/might+do；2)与过去事实相反：If+主语+had done, 主语+would/could/might+have done；3)与将来事实相反：If+主语+should do/were to do, 主语+would+do；4)wish后的虚拟：wish+主语+did（现在）/had done（过去）/would do（将来）；5)suggest/demand/insist等动词后的that从句用(should)+动词原形。}}

{{核心语法-倒装句}}{{倒装句是考研英语翻译和写作的重要考点。主要类型：1)全部倒装：Here comes the bus./Out rushed the children.；2)部分倒装：Never have I seen such a beautiful sunset.；3)Only+状语置于句首：Only by working hard can we succeed.；4)Not only...but also...引导的倒装：Not only did he finish the work, but he also helped others.；5)So/Such...that...引导的倒装：So beautiful was the scenery that everyone was stunned.；6)as引导的让步状语从句：Young as he is, he is very mature.}}

{{阅读高频词汇汇总}}{{考研英语阅读高频词汇分类记忆：1)经济类：recession（衰退）、inflation（通货膨胀）、deficit（赤字）、surplus（盈余）、dividend（红利）、tariff（关税）、subsidy（补贴）、budget（预算）；2)科技类：algorithm（算法）、automation（自动化）、innovation（创新）、disruption（颠覆）、cybersecurity（网络安全）、quantum（量子的）；3)社会类：inequality（不平等）、discrimination（歧视）、demographic（人口统计的）、urbanization（城市化）、migration（迁移）；4)环境类：emission（排放）、biodiversity（生物多样性）、sustainability（可持续性）、ecosystem（生态系统）、degradation（退化）。}}

{{完形高频搭配}}{{考研英语完形填空高频固定搭配：1)动词+介词：contribute to, result in, consist of, depend on, refer to, adapt to, amount to, appeal to；2)形容词+介词：responsible for, capable of, aware of, consistent with, familiar with, relevant to, subject to, susceptible to；3)名词+介词：approach to, access to, solution to, attitude toward, impact on, emphasis on, reliance on, influence on；4)副词搭配：increasingly important, largely due to, primarily because, partially completed, widely accepted.}}

{{翻译常用句型}}{{考研英语翻译常用句型和技巧：1)It is+adj+that...句型：It is essential that we take action.；2)There is no denying that...不可否认...；3)The reason why...is that...的原因是...；4)Not only...but also...不仅...而且...；5)So...that...如此...以至于...；6)such...that...如此...以至于...；7)the more...the more...越...越...；8)It is not until...that...直到...才...；9)No sooner...than...一...就...；10)Hardly...when...一...就...。翻译时注意中英文语序差异和被动语态的灵活处理。}}

{{写作高分句型}}{{考研英语写作高分句型模板：1)开头句型：The picture/graph/chart vividly illustrates that...；As is symbolically depicted in the picture...；2)论证句型：There are several reasons accounting for this phenomenon.；A number of factors contribute to this trend.；3)举例句型：A case in point is...；Take...for example/instance.；4)对比句型：Compared with...,...；In contrast to...,...；5)总结句型：In conclusion/To sum up/All things considered...；6)建议句型：It is imperative that...；Measures should be taken to...；7)倒装句：Only in this way can we...；Not until then did we realize...；8)虚拟语气：If I were..., I would...；It is high time that we took action.}}

{{解题技巧-写作-2025版黄皮书-2024}}{{1)写作前花3-5分钟审题和构思；2)结构清晰，每段一个中心思想；3)语言准确，语法正确比词汇高级更重要；4)内容充实，善用举例和对比；5)书写工整，卷面整洁。}}
